WEBVTT

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:15.340
It pitches first

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:20.350
One tap builds a whole game

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:39.370
Or ask for a whole game at once

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.400
The playtest fails — for real

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.050
It repairs its own work

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:49.480
It keeps pitching

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:57.367
One tap reverts the ask
